{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54550","headline":"兵要望江南 占气第四（京本作「占气第二十三」○三十一首） 十一 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占气第四（京本作「占气第二十三」○三十一首） 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"猛将气，持戟（京本作「戈」）又（辛本、川本、京本作「或」）持刀。\n林下森森弓弩样，色兼青白若脂膏，将士尽雄豪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54550.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54550","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}